OL,3,CPolice given more powers as increased
OL,4,Cvisitor numbers expected at coastal
OL,5,Ctowns
OL,7,FDispersal orders have been introduced
OL,8,Facross Thanet this weekend as an
OL,9,Fincreased number of visitors are
OL,10,Fexpected.
OL,12,FA number of public events are taking
OL,13,Fplace including the start of Folk Week
OL,14,Fin Broadstairs, Margate Pride and
OL,15,Fseveral music events hosted at
OL,16,FDreamland.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
