FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786358876
OL,3,CPolice given more powers as increased
OL,4,Cvisitor numbers expected at coastal
OL,5,Ctowns
OL,7,FIn anticipation of large crowds,
OL,8,Fsection 34 dispersal orders have been
OL,9,Fauthorised for across the area, giving
OL,10,Fofficers increased powers to tackle
OL,11,Fantisocial behaviour.
OL,13,FFrom 4pm yesterday (Friday 7 August
OL,14,F2026), anyone suspected to be behaving
OL,15,Fin an antisocial manner in
OL,16,FBroadstairs, Ramsgate, or Margate town
OL,17,Fcentres as well as their seafronts
OL,18,Fwill be asked to move on or face
OL,19,Farrest if they fail to do so.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786358876
OL,3,CPolice given more powers as increased
OL,4,Cvisitor numbers expected at coastal
OL,5,Ctowns
OL,7,FThe same applies to anyone behaving
OL,8,Fantisocially at the railway stations.
OL,10,FAnyone returning after being asked to
OL,11,Fleave also risks being taken into
OL,12,Fcustody.
OL,14,FItems which are being used in an
OL,15,Fantisocial manner, such as loud music
OL,16,Fequipment, may also be seized.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
