OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786358876
OL,3,CPolice given more powers as increased
OL,4,Cvisitor numbers expected at coastal
OL,5,Ctowns
OL,7,FChief Inspector Ian Swallow said:
OL,8,F"This is set to be an exceptionally
OL,9,Fbusy weekend in Thanet, with multiple
OL,10,Fevents expected to bring visitors and
OL,11,Fcommunities together.
OL,13,FWe want everyone to enjoy what our
OL,14,Ftowns have to offer safely and
OL,15,Fresponsibly.
OL,17,FOfficers will be out on the streets
OL,18,Fthroughout the weekend to support the
OL,19,Fsafe facility of events and to engage
OL,20,Fwith residents and visitors.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786358876
OL,3,CPolice given more powers as increased
OL,4,Cvisitor numbers expected at coastal
OL,5,Ctowns
OL,7,FWhile the vast majority of people will
OL,8,Fbe there to enjoy themselves, anyone
OL,9,Ffound behaving in an antisocial manner
OL,10,Fcan expect to be dealt with promptly
OL,11,Fand robustly.
OL,13,FWe are determined to make sure that a
OL,14,Fsmall group of people do not ruin the
OL,15,Fweekend for those simply looking to
OL,16,Fenjoy themselves.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
