PN,38806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1786358876
OL,3,CPolice given more powers as increased
OL,4,Cvisitor numbers expected at coastal
OL,5,Ctowns
OL,7,FThe orders, coupled with high
OL,8,Fvisibility patrols are part of the
OL,9,Frobust plans put in place by Kent
OL,10,FPolice to tackle antisocial behaviour
OL,11,Falong the coast as visitor numbers to
OL,12,Fthe area increase over the summer
OL,13,Fperiod.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
